 | Pin Number | Pin Name | Description
 |------------|----------|------------
-| 1 | SCL | Serial clock (input). Requires pullup.
-| 2 | GND | Ground.
-| 3 | ALERT | Overtemperature alert. Open-drain output; requires pull-up resistor.
-| 4 | ADD0 | Address select. Connect to GND, V+, SDA, or SCL.
-| 5 | V+ | Supply voltage, 1.4 V to 3.6 V.
-| 6 | SDA | Serial data (I/O). Open-drain output; requires pull-up resistor.
+| 1          | SCL      | Serial clock input (open-drain, requires pull-up)
+| 2          | GND      | Ground
+| 3          | ALERT    | Alert/thermostat output (open-drain, requires pull-up)
+| 4          | ADD0     | Address select pin: GND→0x48, V+→0x49, SDA→0x4A, SCL→0x4B
+| 5          | V+       | Supply voltage (1.4V to 3.6V)
+| 6          | SDA      | Serial data input/output (open-drain, requires pull-up)
 
